        "quote": "(a) It shall be the duty of the Police Department to keep and maintain a docket (blotter) of all persons arrested and charged with any offense under the ordinances of the City or laws of the State and of those persons appearing at police headquarters in answer to a citation to appear for any violation of the traffic ordinances of the City. The docket shall show the offense charged, the time of the arrest, the arresting officer and the final disposition of the case, whether by the Municipal Court of the City or by courts of the State having jurisdiction.",
